                                "example_id": "28afe976-18d1-4043-a92d-19180f1884e7",
                                "sense_id": "7a7fd199-b3a9-3306-94ba-c7a1d40b4f67",
                                "text": "I got it date-stamped at the library desk and put it in my pippy bag and trotted out into the bewildering sunshine."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9aaacf06-1d89-4c8f-bd01-10cdf1478ee3",
                                "sense_id": "7a7fd199-b3a9-3306-94ba-c7a1d40b4f67",
                                "text": "Perhaps the good professor should add to his files Goolwa cockle: the name, according at least to the fishing books I have perused, the pippy goes under in South Australia."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0cc0926f-85ca-49f4-b920-d3187f8292f4",
                                "sense_id": "7a7fd199-b3a9-3306-94ba-c7a1d40b4f67",
                                "text": "As a child, because the rumpled foreskin on my pippy stuck uncomfortably to the loose skin of my scrotum, I would occasionally be observed trying to separate them through my clothing."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
